  "description": {
    "text": "BREAK Combo Deck 60: Golduck BREAK + Palkia-EX, a ready-built 60-card Water deck released on 9 October 2015, guaranteed to hold a BREAK Evolution Pokémon, new in the XY BREAK series: Golduck BREAK, with Palkia-EX as its partner in the combo. A playmat, a coin, damage counters and markers, a rule book and a player's guide came with it.",
